    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. it's a bit too aggressive though. can you tone it down a little but still make the point that the old way (managed conservation) is basically just ineffective compared to rewilding? like, emphasize that managed conservation is just a band-aid whereas rewilding is the actual long-term solution.",
